{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">入境處聯同其他部門在皇崗口岸，進行聯合一站式車道實戰演練。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">參與演練的大巴、私家車等車輛，依次通過，五合一車道的香港海關、衞生署、入境處、深圳邊檢及海關檢查，以模擬出入境流程及突發系統故障處理程序。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER-2200_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026AP17HWvB0A1787841699.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BORDER-2200_002.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">處方指，演練進一步優化流程及系統性能，確保通過流程穩定性及提升通關效率。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T14:59:45.837826+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}